/// 法定主体事实变更点台账（事实表，来源于人工治理、工商变更或受控主数据导入；只追加，不原地覆盖）
model PartyLegalFactRevision {
  id                     Int                      @id @default(autoincrement())
  partyId                Int
  revision               Int
  commandKind            String
  effectiveOn            DateTime                 @db.Date
  recordState            String                   @default("confirmed")
  supersedesId           Int?                     @unique
  subjectType            String
  name                   String
  fullName               String?
  identityNumber         String
  legalRepresentative    String?
  registeredCapital      String?
  registeredAddress      String?
  registeredDate         String?
  sourceRegistryChangeId Int?
  sourceType             String?
  sourceLabel            String?
  sourceReference        String?
  reason                 String?
  idempotencyKey         String                   @unique
  requestFingerprint    String
  recordedBy             Int?
  recordedAt             DateTime                 @default(now())
  party                  Party                    @relation(fields: [partyId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  supersedes             PartyLegalFactRevision?  @relation("PartyLegalFactSupersession", fields: [supersedesId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  supersededBy           PartyLegalFactRevision[] @relation("PartyLegalFactSupersession")

  @@unique([partyId, revision], map: "PartyLegalFactRevision_party_revision_key")
  @@index([partyId, effectiveOn, revision], map: "PartyLegalFactRevision_party_effective_revision_idx")
  @@index([supersedesId], map: "PartyLegalFactRevision_supersedes_idx")
  @@index([sourceRegistryChangeId], map: "PartyLegalFactRevision_registry_change_idx")
}
